</div></div></div><div id="section/WebSocket-API/Unsubscribe-from-market-data" data-section-id="section/WebSocket-API/Unsubscribe-from-market-data" class="sc-dcJsrY bBkGhy"><div class="sc-kAyceB hBQWIZ"><div class="sc-fqkvVR oJKYx"><h2 class="sc-jXbUNg fhuWIa"><a class="sc-jlZhew kbdRLs" href="https://open-api.capital.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com#section/WebSocket-API/Unsubscribe-from-market-data" aria-label="section/WebSocket-API/Unsubscribe-from-market-data"></a>Unsubscribe from market data</h2></div></div><div class="sc-fqkvVR diIqQJ"><div class="sc-eeDRCY sc-dCFHLb gTGgei bIRBNR redoc-markdown "><p><strong>Destination:</strong> <code>marketData.unsubscribe</code></p>
